3820
02:26:43,700 --> 02:26:44,830
- I knew it.
- Okay.

3821
02:26:45,030 --> 02:26:46,430
- Make sure to keep them safe.
- Gosh.

3822
02:26:48,270 --> 02:26:50,400
- Keep them safe.
- Gosh, it's so exhausting.

3823
02:26:50,970 --> 02:26:52,100
